				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3084723 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3084723" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<h2>Hire The Best Candidates the Right Way to<br /><span style="color: var(--brand-orange, #f56b01);">Expand Your Business</span></h2>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8ea7dc0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="8ea7dc0" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>We help you to compliantly hire, pay, and manage the right talent across the Middle East.<br />When it comes to expanding your company abroad, the hiring process in the Middle East can be especially difficult if you’re not familiar with local regulations, traditions, pay cycles, and management styles.<br />EOR ME is an EOR provider in the Middle East that specializes in making your company expansion hassle-free and smooth, so you can focus on your business priorities. </p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7a01498 elementor-mobile-align-justify elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="7a01498" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
