			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1d6d173 elementor-widget elementor-widget-sectiontitle" data-id="1d6d173" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="sectiontitle.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					
				<div class="">

			<div class="section-title t_left">
                 
                        <h5>// ABOUT THE COMPANY</h5>
                				
				 				
				 				<div class="bar-main">
					<div class="bar bar-big"></div>
				</div>
				
                				

				
			</div>	

		</div>

		
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a627ced elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="a627ced" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<h2><span style="color: var(--brand-orange, #f56b01);">A Trusted EOR Provider</span> in the Middle East</h2>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5ae2d9c elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="5ae2d9c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">From onboarding to payroll management to regulations, we ensure all expansion and hiring plans are compliant with local regulations. </span></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Your Middle East expansion shouldn’t take up valuable company time and resources. With EOR services like EOR ME, you can focus on your normal business tasks and leave opening your new expansion to us. <br /><br />We already have the best talent on standby, making the hiring process in the Middle East a breeze, and because we’re already working in the local market, we can give you clear and concise instructions on how to manage your new team. We’ll even handle the backend tasks like human resources, payroll, and hiring process. </span></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We’re a trusted EOR provider in the Middle East, and we’re ready to help you spread your company throughout the region.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
