				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-07afe2d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="07afe2d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Employer of record services are designed to handle the logistics of opening a new office or branch in regions you are not familiar with. They handle the hiring process in the Middle East, selecting from a previously curated pool of talent. They also make sure your new employees are receiving everything they need to operate in the country without you having to learn what is expected. That includes HR services, payroll management, internal logistics and office establishment, and more. If you’re looking for a new Middle East expansion and don’t know where to begin, EOR services like EOR ME should be your first stop. </span></p>								</div>
				</div>
